  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "What this board can tell you, and what it cannot",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**A score is only as current as the scan behind it.** A node whose scanner stopped keeps displaying its last result indefinitely and looks identical to one scanned this morning. Oldest Scan and Scan Freshness below are how you tell; nothing else on this board knows the difference.\n\n**The average spans whatever the Benchmark picker is showing.** Left on All it averages across every benchmark in the estate, which are different exams: on a mixed fleet the spread between the best and worst platform is routinely twenty points or more, and one platform in real trouble disappears inside a healthy-looking mean. Pick a benchmark before quoting a number.\n\n**These averages include every scanned node, whatever state it is in.** Nodes in noop, nodes whose last run failed, nodes whose scan predates their last catalogue change \u2014 all of them count here exactly as much as a healthy node does. **PDCTNG Evidence Quality** exists to say how many of these numbers can actually be claimed.\n\n**Which rules are failing is not on this board.** It answers which *nodes*; **PDCTNG CIS Rules** answers which rules, and on how many nodes each. The link is at the top of this board.\n"
      },
      "id": 510649388
    },
    {
      "title": "Below 90%",
      "type": "stat",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(puppet_cis_compliance_score{score_type=\"base\",benchmark=~\"${benchmark}\",profile=~\"${profile}\",environment=~\"${environment}\",alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"} < 90) or (vector(0) and on() (count(puppet_cis_compliance_score{benchmark=~\"${benchmark}\",profile=~\"${profile}\",environment=~\"${environment}\",alias=~\"${pe}\",job=~\"${pdctng_job}\"}) > 0))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#8e949f",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#0ca30c",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "color": "#fab219",
                "value": 1
              },
              {
                "color": "#d03b3b",
                "value": 10
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "locale"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "description": "Nodes scoring under ninety percent, read against Nodes Scanned for the denominator. The size of the remediation backlog, which an average hides: a fleet averaging 92 can still have a dozen nodes at 60.",
      "id": 1538052034
    },
    {
