      "description": "**The environment and benchmark pickers do not reach this panel.** It subtracts a scored count from a fleet total and neither half can carry those filters: narrowing the scored half by benchmark would count every node running a different operating system as unscanned. Nodes PuppetDB knows about with no compliance score at all. Not the same problem as a stale scan, and usually means the scanner was never classified onto them.",
      "id": 567144935
    },
